    "paras": [
     "Rhabdophis pentasupralabialis is a keelback snake in the family Colubridae. It is endemic to China and known from Sichuan and Yunnan at elevations of 1,200 and 3,200 m (3,900 and 10,500 ft) above sea level. It was originally described as subspecies of Rhabdophis nuchalis."
    ]
